{
  "info": {
    "name": "Study India Fair — Public API",
    "description": "Public (no-auth) endpoints for the Study India Fair website frontend.\n\n**Setup**\n- Set `serverUrl` collection variable (default `http://localhost:4000`). `baseUrl` = `{{serverUrl}}/api/v1`.\n- Set `uploadUrl` to the upload server (default `http://localhost:4001`).\n\n**Image / file paths**\nAll `*_path` / `path` fields are relative (e.g. `/uploads/gallery/abc.webp`). Build the full URL as `{{uploadUrl}}` + path.\n\n**Rich text**\nFields like `answer`, `details`, `content`, `notice` are Editor.js JSON (`{ time, version, blocks: [{ type, data }] }`) or `null`.\n\n**Errors**\nAll errors return `{ \"message\": string, \"details\"?: any }`.\n- `404` — not found\n- `422` — validation failed (`details` holds zod `fieldErrors`/`formErrors`)\n- `429` — rate limited\n- `500` — internal server error",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "serverUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000"
    },
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "{{serverUrl}}/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "uploadUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4001"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{serverUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{serverUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Server health. Lives at `/health` (outside `/api/v1`). Returns `{ \"ok\": true }`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
